GET {{baseUrl}}/machine-listings/machine-id-here

### 28. Create Machine Listing (Protected)
POST {{baseUrl}}/machine-listings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Caterpillar 320D Excavator 2015",
