###############################################
# SEARCH & FILTER EXAMPLES
###############################################

### Search cars by keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/car-listings?search=Toyota&province=Luanda

### Filter houses by bedrooms and price
GET {{baseUrl}}/house-listings?minBedrooms=3&maxBedrooms=4&minPrice=50000000&maxPrice=100000000

### Search land for agriculture
GET {{baseUrl}}/land-listings?search=agricultura&province=Benguela

### Get machines sorted by price
GET {{baseUrl}}/machine-listings?sort=price_asc&condition=USED

### Pagination example
GET {{baseUrl}}/car-listings?page=2&limit=10

